# Language

- Write every file in `.cursor/rules/` and `.cursor/skills/` in English, including the frontmatter `description` and the body.
- Write `README.md` and files in `requirements/` in Ukrainian, including the README tree comments.
- Keep this split when rules overlap: rule and skill text stays English, README text stays Ukrainian.
